ger (only its `reviewer_findings_recorded` rows), so an older round finishing last cannot close a finding a newer round repeated. The guard `HoldRoundUntilEveryReviewerFinished` (listener on `workflow.review_round.guard.complete`) blocks the move while a reviewer is `queued` or `running`; a round that is already `complete` has no `complete` transition, so a second finisher or a redelivered message does nothing. Whichever reviewer finishes last completes the round.
