+## Symfony components
+
+| Messenger | command and query buses; a rate-limited reviewer retries after `getRetryAfter()` through `RecoverableExceptionInterface::getRetryDelay()`; the failure transport means `blocked`. Built: the two buses `command.bus` and `query.bus`, the typed handler attributes `AsCommandHandler` and `AsQueryHandler`, the `async` Doctrine transport that carries one message per reviewer of a round (its table from the migrations, `auto_setup` off, `redeliver_timeout` above the reviewer hold), `RecoverableMessageHandlingException` with a retry delay for a message that finds its reviewer held by a live worker, `ReviewerRateLimited` (retry delay from `getRetryAfter()`), `JudgeLimited` (the same for the judge call of a round), `EscalationLimited` (the same for the escalation review's busy account or rate limit, and for a transient failure with `forceRetry` off (Messenger 8.1) so the transport's `max_retries` bound it), and the `failed` failure transport with `BlockReviewerOfFailedMessage` and, for a judging that fails for good, the `DispatchOnFailureStamp` (Messenger 8.2) of `JudgeRound` carrying `RecordFailedJudging`, which the `#[AsMessageMiddleware]` (Messenger 8.2) `StampFailureOfEarlierJudging` adds on receipt to a judging queued without it, and for an escalation review parked for good the `DispatchOnFailureStamp` of `EscalateRecurringP1` carrying `RecordFailedEscalation`; the retry strategy's `max_delay` caps the wait of a retry without its own delay at one minute; the first query handler, `VerdictsOfRoundHandler`, reads a round's verdicts with their standing; the image runs `messenger:consume` workers with `--memory-limit` and `--time-limit`, stopped on SIGTERM after the current message (`pcntl`) | in progress | T9 (#14, part #271), `config/packages/messenger.yaml`, `src/Core/Platform/Contract/AsCommandHandler.php`, `src/Core/Platform/Contract/AsQueryHandler.php`; T9 (#14, part #240), `src/Core/Review/UseCase/RunReviewRound/`; T9 (#14, part #241), `src/Core/Review/UseCase/RunReviewRound/ReviewerRateLimited.php`, `src/Core/Review/UseCase/RunReviewRound/BlockReviewerOfFailedMessage.php`; T11 (#16), `src/Core/Review/UseCase/ReadVerdicts/`; T12 (#17, part #446), `src/Core/Review/UseCase/JudgeRound/`; T12 (#17, part #460), `src/Core/Review/UseCase/JudgeRound/QueueJudgingOfCompletedRound.php`; T61 (#1759), `src/Core/Review/UseCase/EscalateRecurringP1/`; T22 (#28, part #690), `docker/entrypoint.sh` |
